{"id": "245637", "name": "מציאת בסיס אורתוגונלי לתת-מרחב הנתון ע\"י בסיס", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "rand_mat3", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון תת המרחב הבא ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> עם המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[W= \\text{span} \\left\\{&nbsp; &nbsp;{{CT:0}},&nbsp;&nbsp;{{CT:1}} &nbsp;\\right\\} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו בסיס אורתוגונלי ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> שנסמנו ב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>.</p><p>הזינו את הבסיס כרשימה של וקטורי עמודה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-veclist\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: וקטורי עמודה בתוך סוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[2],[0]), matrix([0],[1],[3])]</code>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הדרך להזנת כפל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a*b</code>. הדרך להזנת חילוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> היא <code dir=\"ltr\">a/b</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"direction: ltr;\"></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([?],[?],[?]),matrix([?],[?],[?])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "length(ans1)", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. כמות וקטורי הבסיס לא נכונה.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "rank(addcol(ans1[1],ans1[2]))", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. הוקטורים אינם מהווים בסיס.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is(innerproduct(GS_basis[3],ans1[1])=0) and is(innerproduct(GS_basis[3],ans1[2]) = 0)", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. לא כל הוקטורים שנתת הם ב-W.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "innerproduct(ans1[1],ans1[2])", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה. הוקטורים לא אורתוגונליים.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["GS_basis", "matA"], "nvariants": 50}